# Two-player HORSE for the split-screen clip (skate clip two-player-horse): soma-2p-horse-win (SOMA,
# player 1's bot clean, player 2's sketchy) run on past the end so the results card shows.
park soma
cmd 0 player2 join
cmd 0 run horse2p SOMA
bot horse kickflip,heelflip,popshoveit,fs180
p2 bot horse sketchy
run 6900
expect event horseOver{winner=1} count == 1
